Scope
-----
This license covers the measurement data under data/: round records, quote
records, manifests, and the continuity metadata. These are quantities derived
from public on-chain state (Uniswap v4 pool state on Robinhood Chain) and are
independently reproducible from an archive node.

It does NOT cover third-party venue data that is not present in this
repository (aggregator quote responses, prediction-market order books, or any
other keyed source), which remains subject to those providers' own terms. This
repository holds none of it.

Code is licensed separately — see /LICENSE (Apache License 2.0).

No warranty: the data is provided as measured, including its published
limitations (simulated Quoter calls, not executed trades; USDG-quoted pools
only). Quoted figures are not investment advice.
